{"parentUuid":"a21712fb-7655-4df2-a32b-6cb8a2c69af6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"acb01aa0ca95c3510","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017ub7E7oLz2DKm4jK4DpsTo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"add_mir_cuts\" \"add_zero_half_cuts\" CP-SAT parameter default true false\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Cuts\",\"url\":\"https://www-eio.upc.es/lceio/manuals/cplex-11/html/usrcplex/solveMIP14.html\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Parameters - The CP-SAT Primer - Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - d-krupke/cpsat-primer: The CP-SAT Primer: Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/d-krupke/cpsat-primer\"},{\"title\":\"Parameters Affecting Cuts\",\"url\":\"https://www-eio.upc.edu/lceio/manuals/cplex90/usrcplex/solveMIP11.html\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT for scheduling Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://schedulingseminar.com/presentations/SchedulingSeminar_LaurentPerron.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Knitro / AMPL reference — Artelys Knitro 15.1 User's Manual\",\"url\":\"https://www.artelys.com/app/docs/knitro/3_referenceManual/knitroamplReference.html\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found the information about these CP-SAT parameters:\n\n`add_mir_cuts` has a default value of `true`, and `add_zero_half_cuts` also has a default value of `true` in Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT solver.\n\nThese parameters control cut generation in the CP-SAT solver:\n- The `add_mir_cuts` parameter controls whether MIR (Mixed Integer Rounding) cuts are generated\n- The `add_zero_half_cuts` parameter controls whether Zero-Half cuts are generated at the root node\n\nBoth parameters are boolean types and are enabled by default.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e18dbcc4-2e05-4ea3-a459-59c351e90521","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:13.712Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a21712fb-7655-4df2-a32b-6cb8a2c69af6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f2dfa95d-6df2-4bee-9dfe-4bd94430ec97","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"acb01aa0ca95c3510","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W5dX1NQKYuGtkQbxhv7t6Q","type":"tool_result","content":"# LP and Cuts Parameters\n\nBased on the provided `sat_parameters.proto` file, I found limited LP and cuts-related parameters explicitly documented in the visible portion. The file shown ends around line 1000, and many LP-specific parameters may be in the unshown remainder. Here are the parameters I could identify:\n\n| Parameter | Default | Explanation |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `linearization_level` | Not shown | Controls linear relaxation depth for constraint encoding |\n| `add_clique_cuts` | Not shown | Enables clique inequality cuts during solving |\n| `add_zero_half_cuts` | Not shown | Activates zero-half cutting planes |\n| `add_mir_cuts` | Not shown | Enables mixed-integer rounding cuts |\n| `add_rlt_cuts` | Not shown | Adds Reformulation Linearization Technique cuts |\n| `add_lin_max_cuts` | Not shown | Generates cuts for linear maximum constraints |\n| `add_objective_cut` | Not shown | Includes objective function cutting planes |\n| `cut_active_count_decay` | Not shown | Decay rate for cut activity scoring |\n| `max_cut_rounds_at_level_zero` | Not shown | Limits root node cutting plane iterations |\n| `root_lp_iterations` | Not shown | Maximum LP solver iterations at root |\n| `use_dual_simplex` | Not shown | Selects dual vs. primal simplex algorithm |\n| `use_implied_bounds` | Not shown | Leverages implied variable bounds in LP |\n| `polish_lp_solution` | Not shown | Post-processes LP solutions |\n| `add_cg_cuts` | Not shown | Enables Chvátal-Gomory cutting planes |\n| `max_num_cuts` | Not shown | Overall limit on generated cuts |\n\n**Note:** These parameters appear in the file's comments but aren't fully visible in the excerpt provided. The complete definitions likely exist in the unshown portion."}]},"uuid":"365e1248-31af-4929-8655-5a688f9d1981","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:16.354Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f2dfa95d-6df2-4bee-9dfe-4bd94430ec97","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
